          "tool_output": "# Meridian Analytics \u2014 Employee Onboarding Guide\n\nWelcome to Meridian Analytics! This guide covers everything you need for a smooth first\nweek. If anything is unclear, reach out to your manager or HR.\n\n---\n\n## Day 1 Setup\n\n### Accounts & Access\n- [ ] Receive your Meridian email (`<firstname>.<lastname>@meridiananalytics.io`) from IT\n- [ ] Set up Google Workspace (Gmail, Calendar, Drive)\n- [ ] Activate your Slack account and join `#general`, `#engineering`, `#announcements`\n- [ ] Log in to the Meridian Analytics platform at `app.meridiananalytics.io`\n- [ ] Set up 1Password (password manager) \u2014 your vault invite arrives by email\n- [ ] Enable MFA on all company accounts before Day 2\n\n### Physical / Badge\n- [ ] Collect your office keycard from Kenji Obi (HR Manager) \u2014 desk 4B, second floor\n- [ ] Sign the equipment acceptance form for your assigned laptop\n- [ ] Take a building safety briefing with the office manager\n\n### Tools to Install\n| Tool | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| Slack | Team communication |\n| Zoom | Video calls |\n| GitHub | Source code (Engineering) |\n| Figma | Design collaboration (Product/Engineering) |\n| Notion | Internal documentation |\n\n---\n\n## Week 1 Tasks\n\n- [ ] 1:1 with your direct manager (Day 1, 30 min)\n- [ ] Team introduction call \u2014 attend `#standup` at 9:30 am daily\n- [ ] Read the Company Handbook in Notion (link shared on Day 1)\n- [ ] Complete Security Awareness training (mandatory, ~45 min)\n- [ ] Complete GDPR & Data Handling training (mandatory, ~30 min)\n- [ ] Shadow a colleague in your team for half a day\n- [ ] Submit your signed offer letter copy and ID documents to Kenji Obi\n- [ ] Set up your direct deposit and benefits enrolment in Rippling (deadline: Day 5)\n\n---\n\n## Key Contacts\n\n| Name | Role | Department | Email |\n|------|------|------------|-------|\n| Kenji Obi | HR Manager | HR | k.obi@meridiananalytics.io |\n| Priya Nair | CTO | Engineering | p.nair@meridiananalytics.io |\n| Rachel Kim | VP of Sales | Sales | r.kim@meridiananalytics.io |\n| Hannah Park | Head of Product | Product | h.park@meridiananalytics.io |\n| Claire Fontaine | CFO | Finance | c.fontaine@meridiananalytics.io |\n\nFor IT issues: open a ticket in the `#it-help` Slack channel.\n\n---\n\n## Policies Summary\n\n- **Working hours:** Core hours are 10 am \u2013 4 pm local time. Flexible outside these times.\n- **Expenses:** Submit expenses within 30 days of purchase via Ramp. Meals > $75 require\n  prior approval. Hardware purchases > $300 require manager sign-off.\n- **PTO:** 20 days per year (accrued monthly). Submit requests in Rippling \u2265 5 business\n  days in advance for planned leave.\n- **Remote work:** Fully remote-friendly. Office available Tuesday\u2013Thursday.\n- **Confidentiality:** All employees sign an NDA on Day 1. Do not share customer data,\n  deal information, or financial figures outside the company.\n- **Code of Conduct:** Reviewed during Week 1 training. Zero tolerance for harassment.\n\nFor the full policy list see the Company Handbook in Notion.\n",
